This subpackage contains the Tinos font. It was designed by Steve Matteson 
as an innovative, refreshing serif design that is metrically compatible 
with Times New Roman. Tinos offers improved on-screen readability 
characteristics and the pan-European WGL character set and solves the 
needs of developers looking for width-compatible fonts to address document 
portability across platforms.

https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Tinos
